---
config:
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
    messageFontSize: 20
    noteFontSize: 20
    actorFontSize: 20
    actorMargin: 30
    width: 130
    noteMargin: 8
---
sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant P as PWA
  participant B as Backend
  participant AS as Authorization Service
  participant DB as Application Database
  actor S as Staff

  U->>P: Press Check In
  P->>B: Request Check In
  B->>AS: Validate current authorization
  AS-->>B: Authorization result
  Note over B: Invalid authorization stops Check In
  B->>DB: Read current facility session
  DB-->>B: Session status
  Note over P,B: Existing active session returns current Gym ID
  B-->>P: Request location for a new session
  P->>U: Ask for device location
  U-->>P: Provide permission and location
  P->>B: Send location result
  Note over B: Invalid or unavailable location rejects new session
  B->>DB: Atomically check and create 2-hour session
  DB-->>B: Session created
  B-->>P: Return current Gym ID
  P-->>U: Display Gym ID
  S->>B: Verify current Gym ID
  B->>DB: Read active session
  DB-->>B: Current session state
  B-->>S: Confirm valid session
  Note over B,DB: Session expires after 2 hours and occupancy updates
